---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<BaseLayout
  path="/privacy"
  title="Privacy Policy — Aegi"
  description="Privacy Policy for Aegi, the pregnancy and baby tracker app by Zerothreeone LLC."
>
  <main class="legal-page">
    <div class="wrap">
      <header class="legal-header">
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="legal-meta">Effective Date: May 23, 2026</p>
        <p class="legal-intro">
          Aegi ("the App") is operated by Zerothreeone LLC ("Company," "we," "our," or "us"), a California limited liability company.
        </p>
        <p class="legal-intro">
          This Privacy Policy explains how information is handled when you use Aegi.
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="legal-body">

        <section>
          <h2>1. Overview</h2>
          <p>Aegi is designed as a personal pregnancy, baby, and family tracking companion. We prioritize privacy and data minimization.</p>
          <p>Most information entered into the App is stored locally on your device and is not transmitted to our servers.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
          <h3>Information Stored Locally on Your Device</h3>
          <p>The App may allow you to store information such as:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Pregnancy tracking data</li>
            <li>Baby tracking logs</li>
            <li>Feeding records</li>
            <li>Sleep records</li>
            <li>Contraction timing data</li>
            <li>Kick counter data</li>
            <li>Journal entries</li>
            <li>Child profile information</li>
            <li>Preferences and settings</li>
          </ul>
          <p>This information is stored locally on your device and is not accessible to us.</p>
          <p>We do not operate servers for storing your personal tracking data.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>3. Analytics and Usage Information</h2>
          <p>We use third-party analytics services, including:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Firebase Analytics</li>
            <li>Google Analytics for Firebase</li>
          </ul>
          <p>These services may automatically collect limited technical and usage information, including:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Device type</li>
            <li>Operating system version</li>
            <li>App interactions</li>
            <li>Crash data</li>
            <li>Performance diagnostics</li>
            <li>Anonymous usage statistics</li>
          </ul>
          <p>This information helps us improve app stability, usability, and performance.</p>
          <p>Analytics providers may use identifiers associated with your device in accordance with their own privacy policies.</p>
          <p>Google's Privacy Policy: <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://policies.google.com/privacy</a></p>
          <p>Firebase Privacy and Security: <a href="https://firebase.google.com/support/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://firebase.google.com/support/privacy</a></p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>4. No Medical Services</h2>
          <p>Aegi is intended for informational, wellness, organizational, and tracking purposes only.</p>
          <p>The App is not a medical device and does not provide medical advice, diagnosis, treatment, or emergency services.</p>
          <p>Always consult a qualified healthcare provider regarding medical concerns.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>5. Data Sharing</h2>
          <p>Because most user information is stored locally on your device, we generally do not possess or share your personal tracking information.</p>
          <p>We do not sell personal information.</p>
          <p>We may share limited analytics data with our analytics providers solely for app functionality, diagnostics, and improvement purposes.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>6. Data Retention</h2>
          <p>Since personal tracking information is stored locally on your device, you control its retention and deletion.</p>
          <p>Deleting the App may remove locally stored information unless backed up through your own device backup systems.</p>
          <p>Analytics data collected by third-party providers may be retained according to their own policies.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>7. Your Privacy Rights</h2>
          <p>Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have rights regarding information collected through analytics services, including rights to access, delete, or restrict certain data processing activities.</p>
          <p>California residents may have rights under the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA/CPRA).</p>
          <p>Because we do not maintain user accounts or store personal tracking information on our own servers, our ability to identify or access user-specific data may be limited.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>8. Children's Privacy</h2>
          <p>Aegi is intended for use by parents, guardians, and families.</p>
          <p>We do not knowingly collect personal information directly from children under 13 through our own servers or systems.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>9. Security</h2>
          <p>We take reasonable measures to protect the App and associated services. However, no method of electronic storage or transmission is completely secure.</p>
          <p>Users are responsible for maintaining the security of their own devices and backups.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>10. International Users</h2>
          <p>If you use the App outside the United States, you understand that analytics information may be processed in countries where our service providers operate.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>11. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
          <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Updated versions will be posted within the App or associated distribution platforms with a revised effective date.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>12. Contact Us</h2>
          <p>If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, you may contact:</p>
          <p class="legal-contact">
            Zerothreeone LLC<br />
            California, United States<br />
            <a href="mailto:support@zerothreeone.dev">support@zerothreeone.dev</a>
          </p>
        </section>

      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
